Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:31:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] rstrtmgr: Restart Manager sessions, resource registration,
 affected application list, shutdown and restart

- RmStartSession/RmJoinSession/RmEndSession keep real sessions with a random session key
- RmRegisterResources records files, processes (id and start time) and services
- RmGetList reports the running processes that were registered, that run or have loaded a registered file
  (from the real process list), and the registered services that are running; the caller reports
  RmRebootReasonDetectedSelf
- RmShutdown closes the top-level windows (or stops services), terminating only with the force flag, and
  honours RmNoShutdown filters; RmRestart starts the services that RmShutdown stopped
- RmAddFilter/RmRemoveFilter/RmCancelCurrentTask

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

